  "published": "2026-11-19T20:42:22.513Z",
  "releaseNotes": "New features:\n* Added an optional line number to the messages panel\n\nImprovements:\n* Enforce encryption and certificate checks for TDS Endpoint connections\n* Stripped unnecessary information from telemetry data\n* Perform quick initial TDS Endpoint compatibility check without requiring a full connection for improved performance\n\nFixes:\n* Perform standard type conversions when extracting data from a cursor",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Convert SQL queries to FetchXML and execute them against Dataverse / D365",
  "title": "SQL 4 CDS",
